  "question": {
    "text": "The acute angle of intersection of the curves <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> in the first quadrant is <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>θ</mi><mo>,</mo></math> then <math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow></math>&nbsp;is equal to"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>1</mn></math>",
